  "description": "Singapore Art Museum - Olafur Eliasson: Your curious journey. The theme of this exhibition is how to visualise things that cannot be grasped or grasped, such as air, space, and climate change. At first glance, it may sound difficult, but there are many experiential works and many that can be enjoyed intuitively. There are many original and fascinating works that can be enjoyed by both adults and children. 📍: 39 Keppel Rd, #01-02 Tanjong Pagar Distripark, Singapore 089065 📆: 10 May - 22 September 2024 🕥: 10am - 7pm 🚇: Free shuttle bus from Harbourfront MRT (Exit D) on weekends & public holidays  #singaporeartmuseum #olafureliasson #yourcuriousjourneysg #tanjongpagar #tanjongpagardistripark #singapore #visitsingapore #singaporemuseum ",
